{{!
    @template local_oksigeniaaty/email_link

    An e-mail with one thing to do: a band with the centre's name, a few words and a button. Tables and inline styles,
    which is what mail programs read.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * lang - The language of the message.
    * preheader - What the inbox shows next to the subject.
    * name - The centre's name.
    * logo - A small white logo for the band (may be empty).
    * band, ink - The centre's colour and the text that reads on it.
    * hello, heading - The greeting and the title.
    * lead - The paragraphs above the button.
    * buttonurl, buttontext - The button.
    * after - The paragraphs below the button.
    * why - Why this message came.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "lang": "es",
        "preheader": "Abre este correo en tu móvil.",
        "name": "Centro de ejemplo",
        "logo": "",
        "band": "#17574c",
        "ink": "#ffffff",
        "hello": "Hola, Ana:",
        "heading": "Ya puedes usar la app",
        "lead": ["Abre este correo en tu móvil y pulsa el botón."],
        "buttonurl": "https://example.org/local/oksigeniaaty/open.php?key=abc",
        "buttontext": "Abrir la app",
        "after": ["El enlace sirve una vez."],
        "why": "Te lo manda Centro de ejemplo."
    }
}}
<!doctype html>
<html lang="{{lang}}">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="color-scheme" content="light">
<meta name="supported-color-schemes" content="light">
<title>{{heading}}</title>
</head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#f1f3f5;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%;">
<div style="display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;">{{preheader}}</div>
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background:#f1f3f5;">
<tr><td align="center" style="padding:24px 12px;">
    <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="width:100%;max-width:560px;background:#ffffff;border-radius:18px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#14181c;">
    <tr><td bgcolor="{{band}}" style="background:{{band}};border-radius:18px 18px 0 0;padding:22px 28px;color:{{ink}};font-size:17px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.3;">
        {{#logo}}<img src="{{logo}}" alt="" height="32" style="display:block;height:32px;width:auto;margin:0 0 10px;border:0;">{{/logo}}
        {{name}}
    </td></tr>
    <tr><td style="padding:30px 28px 8px;">
        <p style="margin:0 0 6px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;">{{hello}}</p>
        <h1 style="margin:0 0 14px;font-size:25px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:700;color:#14181c;">{{heading}}</h1>
        {{#lead}}<p style="margin:0 0 14px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;">{{.}}</p>{{/lead}}
    </td></tr>
    <tr><td style="padding:8px 28px 22px;">
        <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%"><tr>
            <td bgcolor="{{band}}" align="center" style="background:{{band}};border-radius:12px;">
                <a href="{{buttonurl}}" style="display:block;padding:15px 18px;font-size:17px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.2;color:{{ink}};text-decoration:none;">{{buttontext}}</a>
            </td>
        </tr></table>
    </td></tr>
    <tr><td style="padding:0 28px 18px;">
        {{#after}}<p style="margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:#3b4148;">{{.}}</p>{{/after}}
    </td></tr>
    <tr><td style="padding:16px 28px 24px;border-top:1px solid #e6e8eb;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#5c636a;">{{why}}</td></tr>
    </table>
</td></tr>
</table>
</body>
</html>
